What is not here
----------------
No NAM captures are included. The app downloads a capture from TONE3000 only
when its user picks it, with that user's own TONE3000 account. Each capture
belongs to its creator and stays under the license its creator chose; the app
shows that license and writes a credits file beside the converted files.

No Line 6 firmware, code or data is included.

